    "body": "Heavy test result: not complete.\n\n- `the_sample_as_imported_still_generates_the_3d_finish` ran in release for 22 min with one core busy (1332 s CPU). It did not finish. I stopped it at the end of my time box.\n- Before this PR, the test refused R1 in 0.12 s, so S1 never ran on the as-imported sample. Nobody measured its time before.\n- The release gate at the cut runs this test. It can take more than 22 min there. The cut session must decide if that is acceptable, or if the test needs a slimmer job (for example a larger stepover) in a follow-up.\n",
